  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Secretariat of WECAFC in implementing  targeted actions of the 2019-2020 Workplan on improved regional fisheries governance.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">unlocking the potential of offshore pelagic fisheries to contribute to food and nutrition security, poverty alleviation, income, and employment for present and future generations in the Caribbean, through improving the sustainable management of MFAD.

Strengthening the capacity of the IFREMER/WECAFC Working Group on Development of Sustainable Moored FAD Fishing.</narrative>
  </description>
